# Curated list of npm packages to track in registry.json.
#
# One npm package name per line. `#` starts a comment, blank lines are ignored.
# Scoped names are fine (e.g. @ayulab/pi-rewind).
#
# Pin a version with `name@1.2.3`; a bare `name` follows npm's `latest` tag.
# Pinned packages are never bumped by `just update-pi`.
#
# After editing run:
#   just update piExtensions
# which re-resolves every entry and prunes anything removed from this file.
#
# To mirror everything tagged with the npm `pi-package` keyword instead of this
# list, run `node pkgs/piExtensions/generate.mjs --all` (see --help).

pi-web-access
pi-mcp-adapter
